# Heavy reference binaries (~35MB) — provenance in research/SOURCES.md and data/raw/saigon18/SOURCE.md
research/TOU-Analysis_SolarBESS-ENG.pdf
research/fmp_modeling.csv
data/raw/saigon18/2026-01-29_saigon18_excel_model_v2.xlsm

# Deck binaries (source + [repo-checked] copy) — orchestrator + reports are the tracked artifacts
